{"id":"n86009-2-7","stage":3,"title":"통역 · 口译员","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86009-2-7-1","ko":"회의 진행을 도와줄 통역은 다 구했나?","zh":"协助会议进行的口译员都找齐了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회의","meaning":"会，会议","explanation":"회의：会，会议","readings":[{"term":"회의","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73244","senseId":"1","lemma":"회의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회의","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3"}},{"text":"진행을","meaning":"进行，进展","explanation":"진행：进行，进展；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"진행","audio":"/audio/52e94db6f68c7bdf0f11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29010","senseId":"2","lemma":"진행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진행을","audio":"/audio/c814167039248bf3001f.mp3"}},{"text":"도와줄","meaning":"帮忙，帮助","explanation":"도와주다：帮忙，帮助；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"도와주다","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70744","senseId":"1","lemma":"도와주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와줄","audio":"/audio/343c5c45037bd9b3a5ed.mp3"}},{"text":"통역은","meaning":"口译员，翻译，翻译员","explanation":"통역：口译员，翻译，翻译员；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"통역","audio":"/audio/624011eb48def7af62e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86009","senseId":"2","lemma":"통역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통역은","audio":"/audio/9cc3254d400ae674af4c.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"구했나?","meaning":"找，弄，求","explanation":"구하다：找，弄，求；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"구하다","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58299","senseI